    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0368b0e0_fdc0c0ff",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_discovery.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 490,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-13T01:03:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only way for this call to fail is if `CONFIG_USB_PD_DECODE_SOP` is disabled, which is an invalid config for TCPMv2: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/main/include/config.h#6065\n\nThat\u0027s a slightly weird state of affairs, and it could stand to be cleaned up, but I don\u0027t think we need to propagate a failure of `dfp_consume_identity` up through its callers.",
      "parentUuid": "fd6dd7ff_b281fb27",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 490,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 490,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "b53f4b77655a3fe0ad4d3c0725fb88af57b09fbb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f6364c18_734aebe7",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_discovery.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 498,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T19:09:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s basically a programming error for this function and `discovery_vdm_naked` to be called with an unexpected discovery state. Eventually (later in this CL stack), I expect that sending discovery VDMs will be controlled by this state variable, so it should be especially hard to call this function inappropriately.\n\nHowever, I could see an argument for marking the underlying discovery state as failed here to reduce even further likelihood of getting into a weird loop where we repeatedly provoke discovery responses that we aren\u0027t capable of processing.\n\nWhat do you think?",
      "revId": "b53f4b77655a3fe0ad4d3c0725fb88af57b09fbb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "02c5db51_cd5e1b5a",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_discovery.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 498,
      "author": {
        "id": 1149894
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-03T19:43:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it\u0027s possible that a weird loop could occur, we should try to prevent it.",
      "parentUuid": "f6364c18_734aebe7",
      "revId": "b53f4b77655a3fe0ad4d3c0725fb88af57b09fbb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
